-- A nullary ASSUME BOOLEAN fact that carries a TYPICALLY, read by the exported
-- rule. A yscript consultation asks the user for every fact, so the default would
-- be dropped; R5 refuses the module rather than export one that asks a question
-- the source had already answered.
ASSUME `has capacity` IS A BOOLEAN TYPICALLY TRUE
ASSUME `is adult` IS A BOOLEAN

@export May contract
`may contract` MEANS `has capacity` AND `is adult`
